# Tests required

After implementing a feature, bug fix, or behavior change:

1. Run **`npm test`** (Jest unit suite under `__tests__/`)
2. Run **`npm run test:coverage`** when touching `src/` — global coverage on `src/**` must stay at **100%**
3. Run **`npm run typecheck`** when TypeScript surfaces may have changed
4. If any test fails:
   - **Regression:** fix the production code — do not delete or skip the test
   - **Intentional behavior change:** update the test to match the new PRD, and update the PRD in the same change
5. Never use `--no-verify`, skip, or `.only` to hide failures
6. New domain logic (parsers, pickers, thresholds, store rules) should get unit tests in the same change when practical

Definition of done for features includes a **green unit suite at 100% `src/**` coverage**. E2E (Detox/Maestro) is out of scope unless explicitly requested.
